            "notes": "Round 1: These three greens feel the best after I've experimented with several. Winston has an extremely potent round 1, easily 1v1ing most characters in the game. As for powers, get one of the two primary fire augmentations. I haven't found much of a difference between the order of getting them. Keep in mind that [Circuit Breaker](item_ee0bd3b8-4c0d-40e6-a2a2-be20deef0e19) is better for duels while [Electro Cluster](item_2ce040d2-6b47-4be6-83b3-f8266c2c2b48) is better for big team fights / brawls. I slightly prefer the latter for round 1. Try to get an assist on every kill so you make $$$$$!",
