            "notes": "Round 3: Hopefully by this point you're getting ready to Mercy-Rule the enemy team :)\n\nHere's where you can begin freestyling with the build to really adapt to whatever your team needs or your matchup against the opponents calls for. Take whichever primary fire power you didn't take round 1.\n\nIf you're really steamrolling the enemy team, absolutely dunking on their squishy DPS or supports, I would just keep stacking damage onto your primary fire. Best option for this is [Phantasmic Flux](item_5e644a79-cf6e-4196-8d0a-232f75004643), but if you're really rolling in cash you could grab [Eye of the Spider](item_bbaf01d7-340d-4199-b738-86a98d68fe9b). Do grab [Phantasmic Flux](item_5e644a79-cf6e-4196-8d0a-232f75004643) at some point in the build though, that lifesteal is unbeatable.\n\nIf the game is closer and you want a more even-handed loadout (often the case), I recommend either [Nebula Conduit](item_476b7040-54c9-4f0c-8283-b4407f6809f8) or [Weapon Jammer](item_72386db6-753e-413d-aa2a-f1389842f47f). Each are great options that add a little more damage while also supporting your defense. [Nebula Conduit](item_476b7040-54c9-4f0c-8283-b4407f6809f8) is usually the best option, as its damage over time effect couples well with the lifesteal focus of the build. [Weapon Jammer](item_72386db6-753e-413d-aa2a-f1389842f47f) is also nice because it will greatly help you in 1v1's, but also will inflict the attack speed debuff on the entire enemy team with the help of [Electro Cluster](item_2ce040d2-6b47-4be6-83b3-f8266c2c2b48)'s reach. \n\nFor the rest of the guide, I also include [Premium Peanut Butter](item_c4cd51d3-e631-4c4c-9a9f-d586a6d0d5de). This item cleanses negative effects when you jetpack, so it's useful against Ana anti-heal, Junker Queen bleed, Ashe fire, etc. There's also a neat synergy between this item and [Nebula Conduit](item_476b7040-54c9-4f0c-8283-b4407f6809f8), where it cleanses [Nebula Conduit](item_476b7040-54c9-4f0c-8283-b4407f6809f8)'s damage over time effect, making you way tankier.\n\nAt this point, feel free to sell the green items [Compensator](item_2a354f80-610c-4661-9bdd-8960ae1a60b0) and [Ammo Reserves](item_982d53aa-5ef4-493f-93e7-9e374d0ebf34) to afford the purples. However, [Plasma Converter](item_25869f9a-9a29-4e19-96b6-9d8a28c59318) is so good and cheap that it's worth keeping a bit longer (especially if you're not picking up [Phantasmic Flux](item_5e644a79-cf6e-4196-8d0a-232f75004643)).",
