            "notes": "Round 4: At this point, just take the opposite of whatever you did for Round 3, either picking up a more defensive or a more offensive item. [Nebula Conduit](item_476b7040-54c9-4f0c-8283-b4407f6809f8) and [Phantasmic Flux](item_5e644a79-cf6e-4196-8d0a-232f75004643) have a great synergy, but don't be afraid to experiment. A rule of thumb is to keep two lifesteal items in your build at any point after Round 1, but otherwise mold your build with your discretion.",
