            "notes": "Round 7: Round out your build with the last purple you need. At this point you might want to lean tankier, [Martian Mender](item_0099632b-4e18-450e-844f-22c40e51bc98) synergizes well with your enormous lifesteal, shield, and [Nebula Conduit](item_476b7040-54c9-4f0c-8283-b4407f6809f8). [Ogundimu Reduction Field](item_b12daf48-069b-44c1-88fe-221cbcff664d) is also great for drawn out fights.\n\nFor powers, [Moon Landing](item_cc4f210b-31e1-47b2-8400-325afcc4892b) can give you some pretty impressive healing, especially in tight overtime scenarios where you may be in a 1v3 or 4 situation (about a quarter of your health back if you land on all of them!), or grab [Pocket Projector](item_5c95fa4f-6f53-494e-9b4a-a7e2766cb1e8) at this point if you just want more shields ([Tesla Field](item_68f73d99-6d07-40f5-ad28-0c69f45487c7) actually synergizes with it in a funny way, essentially doubling its damage). \n\nGood luck with the exciting Round 7 game point!",
